      "statement": "G1-A1 itself remains limited to neutral in-memory fixtures, expected-hash provenance is not external trust, and G1-A1 does not exercise signer isolation; the frozen Airline projection is separately active through G1-D1, while Supplier / Water Filter projection and Generic MultiRoot are separately active through G1-D2."
